<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθεν-ών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>maidens' apartments</i> in a house, mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				646
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IT</u>
				826
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in sg.,
				<i>the western cella of the Parthenon</i> or <i>temple of
				Athena</i> at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.301.13
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.76
			</span></i>, etc.; also, of the cella of the temple of Artemis at
			Magnesia on Maeander, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				695.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span> ; of the Great Mother at Cyzicus, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Michel</u>
				538.6
			</span></i>, and Hermione, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.743
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> name of a
			month at Alexandria, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				11.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
